# Live server, named only (e2e.py --live localhost --retail --instance NAME run _sb_dock): when the character was
# saved in space (Jupiter sector, beside Jove's Fury; the login then ends in space and _sb_home's first walk-to
# fails), log in and dock, so the next session starts in the station. From the user's recording of 2026-11-15
# (.work/e2e/202650-record, 376-406 s): the target box under the warp button (641,1009) selects the station
# (SET_TARGET), the right verb icon of the target panel (1238,672) docks (ACTION, then the server's SERVER_HANDOFF).
name: live: dock at Jove's Fury from space
timeout: 300
include _login_live
click 641,1009 until antprox 'sent SET_TARGET' every 2 within 20
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot dock_target
click 1238,672 until antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' every 5 within 180
wait-event msg 'Changing room from -1 to 0' within 120
wait-quiet proxy 2.0 within 30
shot docked
alive 20
